{"unit_id":"cn-scuo-oo__dsh-session-auto-title#card-zh","repo":"cn-scuo-oo/dsh-session-auto-title","commit":"59fd8f42d5a12f2bb2c8c526c4cca9e8883b9729","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-auto-title 是一个 DSH 会话标题插件：在每轮对话结束后，读取会话中的人类消息并调用标题模型，把标题整理为“MMDD｜类型｜主题”格式。它注册 sessionTitle provider，并在 turn/end 时显式刷新；日期取会话首条人类消息的上海时区月日，类型从预设类别中选择，主题长度和标题字节数均有限制。插件会保留用户手动修改的标题，也可按配置释放指定会话的一次手动锁定。适合希望会话列表标题持续反映对话内容、并保持统一命名格式的 DSH 用户；无需额外凭据配置，默认沿用请求路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:202-242","lib/index.js:90-98","lib/index.js:148-199"]}
{"unit_id":"cn-scuo-oo__dsh-session-auto-title#card-en","repo":"cn-scuo-oo/dsh-session-auto-title","commit":"59fd8f42d5a12f2bb2c8c526c4cca9e8883b9729","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-auto-title refreshes a DSH session title after each turn using a sessionTitle provider. It formats titles as “MMDD｜类型｜主题” based on the first human message date in Shanghai time, preserves user-renamed titles, and uses the request model route by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:202-242","lib/index.js:90-98","lib/index.js:148-199"]}
