{"unit_id":"cn-scuo-oo__dsh-session-auto-title#feature-1","repo":"cn-scuo-oo/dsh-session-auto-title","commit":"59fd8f42d5a12f2bb2c8c526c4cca9e8883b9729","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-auto-title 的功能「逐轮更新标题」：每次对话轮次结束时触发 sessionTitle.refresh，使用已记录的人类消息重新生成会话标题。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:202-227"]}
{"unit_id":"cn-scuo-oo__dsh-session-auto-title#feature-2","repo":"cn-scuo-oo/dsh-session-auto-title","commit":"59fd8f42d5a12f2bb2c8c526c4cca9e8883b9729","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-auto-title 的功能「统一标题格式」：生成 MMDD｜类型｜主题 标题，日期取首条人类消息的上海时区月日，并限制主题字符数和总字节数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:72-98","lib/index.js:100-137"]}
{"unit_id":"cn-scuo-oo__dsh-session-auto-title#feature-3","repo":"cn-scuo-oo/dsh-session-auto-title","commit":"59fd8f42d5a12f2bb2c8c526c4cca9e8883b9729","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-auto-title 的功能「尊重手动改名」：检测到标题来源为用户时跳过自动刷新；配置 unpinSessions 可释放指定会话的一次锁定。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:202-227","lib/index.js:54-59"]}
{"unit_id":"cn-scuo-oo__dsh-session-auto-title#feature-4","repo":"cn-scuo-oo/dsh-session-auto-title","commit":"59fd8f42d5a12f2bb2c8c526c4cca9e8883b9729","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-auto-title 的功能「校验模型标题」：规范化模型输出并重建日期和类别前缀；超时、输入过大或格式不符时不接受生成结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:119-137","lib/index.js:148-199"]}
{"unit_id":"cn-scuo-oo__dsh-session-auto-title#caveat-1","repo":"cn-scuo-oo/dsh-session-auto-title","commit":"59fd8f42d5a12f2bb2c8c526c4cca9e8883b9729","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-auto-title 会把截取的末尾人类消息作为 JSON 内容发送给标题模型，每轮可能产生额外模型调用；实际路由沿用请求路由，也可配置 provider 和 model。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:148-180","lib/index.js:112-117"]}
